<title>USA: Sabratek wins Omnicare contract.</title>
<headline>Sabratek wins Omnicare contract.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sabratek Corp said Wednesday that Omnicare Inc awarded the company an exclusive contract to provide Omnicare with its multi-therapy infusion pumps and proprietary telemedicine technology.</p>
<p>The value of the agreement was not disclosed.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
